        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Token rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Store only one encrypted refresh token per user.&lt;br&gt;• Short-lived access tokens are generated when needed and discarded.&lt;br&gt;• Never send the refresh token to the extension.&lt;br&gt;• If Google revokes access, mark reauthorization_required." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f9fafb;strokeColor=#9ca3af;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
